Source: maluos-archive
Section: misc
Priority: important
Maintainer: Edward Honour <ed@maludb.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), gnupg
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/maludb/maluos
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: maluos-archive
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, maluos-keyring, postgresql-client-common
Description: APT source configuration for the MaluOS repository
 Installs the deb822 APT source entries that a MaluOS system pulls
 packages from: the MaluOS repository itself and the PostgreSQL Global
 Development Group (PGDG) repository that supplies PostgreSQL 18.
 .
 The PGDG entry is verified with the key shipped by Ubuntu's own
 postgresql-client-common package, so no third-party key is vendored.

Package: maluos-archive-mozilla
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Priority: optional
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: APT source configuration for Mozilla's repository (Firefox)
 Installs the deb822 APT source entry for packages.mozilla.org, Mozilla's
 own repository of Firefox debs, together with its signing key and an APT
 pin that prefers Mozilla's packages over Ubuntu's snap-transitional
 firefox package. The MaluOS desktop takes Firefox from here: no snaps.
 .
 The vendored key is checked against Mozilla's published fingerprint
 (35BA A0B3 3E9E B396 F59C A838 C0BA 5CE6 DC63 15A3) when the package
 is built.
